  vault: `command: fleet-axi vault\nusage: bin/fleet-axi vault [${VAULT_FILTERS.join("|")}] [--id <task>] [--full]\nflags[3]{flag,description}:\n  --id,one task's detail (what it waits on and blocks)\n  --full,long text uncut and every row\n  --help,show this help\nexamples[3]:\n  bin/fleet-axi vault\n  bin/fleet-axi vault in-progress\n  bin/fleet-axi vault --id fleet-observe-reviews`,
